{"id":"fro_hlich","lemma":"fröhlich","pos":"adj","rank":2783,"glosses":["merry; cheerful; either as a character trait or fleetingly"],"ipa":"/ˈfʁøːlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/De-fr%C3%B6hlich.ogg/De-fr%C3%B6hlich.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"fröhlicher","superlative":"am fröhlichsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich will, dass ihr fröhlich seid.","en":"I want you to have fun.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756099","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Er ist ein fröhlicher alter Mann.","en":"He is a cheerful old man.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"old man-made tunnel"]]},{"text":"Sie sind sehr fröhlich.","en":"They are very cheerful.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Dieses Lied macht mich fröhlich.","en":"This song makes me happy.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"song"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null]},{"text":"Tom ist kein fröhlicher Junge.","en":"Tom is not a happy boy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759186","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},null,{"g":"boy"}]}]}